high.translation:
At dawn I leave White Emperor amid bright clouds;
A thousand li to Jiangling, home within a day.
The gibbons on both banks are calling without end;
My light boat has already passed ten thousand hills.

low.translation:
At dusk I leave White Emperor amid bright clouds;
A thousand li to Jiangling, home within a year.
The gibbons on both banks are calling without end;
My light boat has already passed ten thousand hills.
